  "description": "The Double Peak 29 Comp utilizes a low stand over, low center of gravity frame made of 6000 series alloy with internal head tube and internal cable routing. The \"DP\" Comp features a lightweight and versatile 1x10 Deore drive train with an FSA Comet 30T crankset. The new and upgraded 29\" Weinmann U-28 alloy wheelset is fitted with efficient Kenda Honey badger 29\" x 2.2\" tires. The front end features an upgraded Suntour XCM 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout. A very capable X-country performance bike the Comp flies but always lands safely thanks to its Shimano MT-201 Hydraulic disc brake set.\nHaro Double Peak Comp 29.0\" Frame 6000 series alloy w/ Internal housing routing\nSR Suntour XCM fork 100mm travel w/ hydraulic lockout\nFSA Comet Modular MegaExo crankset w/ 30t Megatooth Chromoly chainring\nShimano Deore M6000 rear derailleur, Shadow Plus Design\nShimano CS-HG500 10-spd cassette, 11-42T\nShimano Deore M6000 shifter, 1x10-spd\nWeinmann U-28 Disc alloy double wall rims, 29\"x28h\nShimano RM35 alloy hubs, Center Lock Disc, 28h\nKenda Honey Badger XC tires 29.0*2.2\nShimano BL-MT201 / BR-MT200 hydraulic disc brakes, 160mm Center Lock Rotors",
